ators.\r\n\r\nNote that macOS' own Terminal.app and conhost (the legacy Windows console) don't support named URLs, but unnamed URLs can still be used.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14992.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_print_rich_named_url.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28802932/test_print_rich_named_url.zip)\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n        print_rich(\"  Named link: [url=https://example.com]This text points to example.com[/url]. Some more text.\")\r\n        print_rich(\"Unnamed link: [url]https://example.com[/url]. Some more text.\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nDisplayed in the editor Output panel:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"523\" height=\"47\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5230b127-6c2d-4f14-bc8c-e3b4737c317b\" />\r\n\r\nDisplayed in the VS Code terminal:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"515\" height=\"50\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6ee4859-54c1-47d2-afbc-a6819789107d\" />","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/